---
description: Keep assistant replies short and focused
alwaysApply: true
---

# Concise responses

- Default to short, focused answers. Lead with the direct answer or outcome.
- Skip preamble, recap, and filler unless the user asks for more context.
- Use bullets only when they improve scanability; avoid long nested lists.
- Match depth to the task: one-line fixes get one-line replies; complex work gets structured but still tight prose.
- Do not pad with optional follow-ups at the end unless something is genuinely blocked.
